Effective prompt engineering relies on a few core elements. Learning these will help you communicate clearly with AI models and unlock their full capabilities.

Prompt format

The way you structure your prompt has a major effect on how the AI understands your request. Some models respond better to natural language questions, others to direct commands, and some to structured inputs with specific fields. Understanding the model preferences helps you craft better prompts.";}s:8:"internal";a:2:{s:5:"cache";b:1;s:3:"toc";b:1;}s:8:"relation";a:1:{s:10:"firstimage";s:0:"";}s:11:"last_change";a:10:{s:4:"date";i:1764234527;s:2:"ip";s:9:"127.0.0.1";s:4:"type";s:1:"C";s:2:"id";s:47:"rbz_prompts:1_automat_basics:prompt_engineering";s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:3:"sum";s:23:"created - external edit";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:1235;s:9:"timestamp";i:1764234527;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}}s:10:"persistent";a:4:{s:4:"date";a:1:{s:7:"created";i:1764317497;}s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:7:"creator";s:0:"";s:11:"last_change";a:10:{s:4:"date";i:1764234527;s:2:"ip";s:9:"127.0.0.1";s:4:"type";s:1:"C";s:2:"id";s:47:"rbz_prompts:1_automat_basics:prompt_engineering";s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:3:"sum";s:23:"created - external edit";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:1235;s:9:"timestamp";i:1764234527;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}}}